* A quotient ` U / V ` with ` abs ( U - V ) < M <_ abs V ` lies in the slit plane: its distance from ` 1 ` is below ` 1 ` .

s1::simpl |- ( ( ( U e. CC /\ V e. CC ) /\ ( M e. RR+ /\ M <_ ( abs ` V ) /\ ( abs ` ( U - V ) ) < M ) ) -> ( U e. CC /\ V e. CC ) )
